!Sample_data_processing = Illumina NovaSeq 6000 reads were processed using the TrimGalore toolkit v0.4.1 to trim low quality bases and Illumina sequencing adapters from the 3’ end of the reads.  Only reads that were 20nt or longer after trimming were kept for further analysis. Read quality was checked for each sample using FastQC v0.11.2.
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were mapped to the GRCh38v93 version of the human genome and transcriptome using the STAR RNA-seq alignment tool v2.5.0c.  Reads were kept for subsequent analysis if they mapped to a single genomic location.
!Sample_data_processing = Gene counts were compiled using the HTSeq tool v0.6.1.  Only genes that had at least 10 reads in any given library were used in subsequent analysis.
!Sample_data_processing = Normalization and differential expression was carried out using the DESeq2 Bioconductor package v1.16.1 with the R statistical programming environment v3.4.1_3.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38v93
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: normalized expression matrix in csv format
